# Trackman Design System (TDS4)

This template does **not** ship a token CSS file. TDS4 is Trackman’s design system: colours, typography, spacing, and components are defined in **Figma and internal design-system sources**, not in this repo.

When styling prototypes:

- Aim for an **on-brand Trackman look**: orange brand accent (`#ec691a`), off-white page background (`#f6f6f6`), cards on white — not generic grey UI or default browser styling.
- Prefer **semantic CSS** (`--brand`, `--surface-page`, etc.) in your own `css/` files if that keeps things consistent; align names with TDS concepts (surface elevation, content primary/secondary, stroke) when possible.
- **Do not** paste large vendor token files into the template. If you need the official `--tds-*` variable set, pull it from your team’s current TDS package or design handoff — do not reproduce it here.

For Figma-to-build fidelity, use **Figma inspect + designer agreement** on colours and type; this rule file is only a lightweight reminder, not a token dictionary.
